    {
      "tr": "`[tag.lower() for tag in re.findall(r\"#\\w+\", text)]`.",
      "en": "`[tag.lower() for tag in re.findall(r\"#\\w+\", text)]`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef hashtags(text):\n    return [tag.lower() for tag in re.findall(r\"#\\w+\", text)]\n\nprint(hashtags(\"Loving #Python and #regex! #python\"))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef hashtags(text):\n    return [tag.lower() for tag in re.findall(r\"#\\w+\", text)]\n\nprint(hashtags(\"Loving #Python and #regex! #python\"))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "hashtags",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
